[00:00.30]
[00:23.70]How do I have to change?
{"我该如何改变自己？"}
[00:26.78]Do you think it's not enough?I gave it all
{"你是否觉得还不够？我已付出全部"}
[00:29.89]What have I got to do to make myself be chosen?
{"要怎样做才能被选中？"}
[00:35.91]No second thoughts for me
{"我绝不犹豫退缩"}
[00:38.78]Just wanna be a man or a hero
{"只想成为顶天立地的英雄"}
[00:41.89]Unconsciously I wonder how to be The Special
{"潜意识里渴望成为那个特别存在"}
[00:48.41]
[00:48.42]Dive into the depth of my heart
{"潜入心灵最深处"}
[00:54.19]Find myself feeling childish fears
{"发现自己仍怀着幼稚的恐惧"}
[00:59.99]The invisible hand of God
{"上帝无形之手"}
[01:03.00]Had made us burst their ancient locks
{"已让我们冲破古老枷锁"}
[01:06.03]And now,the world I trusted breaks apart at the seams
{"如今，我曾信任的世界正分崩离析"}
[01:12.53]
[01:12.54]Gotta burn my pride
{"必须燃烧我的骄傲"}
[01:14.23]We'll take a chance to make them crystallize
{"我们要抓住机会让梦想结晶"}
[01:18.70]No one knows our beasts inside will be the demons or the saints
{"无人知晓心中猛兽会成为恶魔还是圣徒"}
[01:24.71]Never doubt myself
{"绝不怀疑自己"}
[01:26.13]Show me your justice,cuz you realize
{"展示你的正义吧，既然你已明白"}
[01:30.00]So long now,my friend
{"再会了朋友"}
[01:33.00]Have a brighter day tomorrow
{"愿你的明天更加灿烂"}
[01:39.30]
[01:50.89]How do I have to change?
{"我该如何改变自己？"}
[01:53.63]Small things will bring and begin big impacts
{"微小事物终将引发巨大变革"}
[01:56.90]His paper castle's gone
{"他的纸城堡已崩塌"}
[01:59.80]Entire ground's still been frozen
{"整片大地依旧冰封"}
[02:02.92]Slipped into evil's sway,he kept on building the lies and fictions
{"滑入邪恶掌控，他不断编织谎言与虚构"}
[02:08.93]We all got lost within ourselves what we should believe in
{"我们都迷失在自我该信仰什么"}
[02:15.34]
[02:15.35]Dive into the depth of my heart
{"潜入心灵最深处"}
[02:21.35]Find myself feeling childish fears
{"发觉自己怀着稚嫩的恐惧"}
[02:27.10]The invisible hand of God
