[02:30.05]Had made us burst their ancient locks
{"已让我们冲破他们古老的枷锁"}
[02:33.10]And now,the world I trusted breaks apart at the seams
{"如今 我曾信赖的世界在接缝处崩裂"}
[02:39.64]
[02:39.65]Gotta light my pride
{"必须点燃我的骄傲"}
[02:41.20]We'll take a chance to make them crystallize
{"我们要抓住机会让它们结晶成形"}
[02:45.69]No one knows our beasts inside will be the demons or the saints
{"无人知晓内心野兽终成恶魔还是圣徒"}
[02:51.70]Never doubt myself
{"绝不怀疑自己"}
[02:53.20]Show me your justice,cuz you realize
{"向我展示你的正义 因你已明白"}
[02:57.10]So long now,my friend
{"再会了 我的朋友"}
[03:00.00]Have a brighter day tomorrow
{"愿你的明天更加灿烂"}
[03:03.42]
[03:06.37]Thousand tears call the shadow of the nightmare
{"千行泪水召唤着噩梦的阴影"}
[03:12.34]Thousand years past,longing for the future
{"千年逝去 仍渴望着未来"}
[03:18.33]Thousand grief shed cruelty and their blood but
{"千般悲痛倾泻残酷与鲜血 但"}
[03:24.28]Thousand beliefs will salvage your souls
{"万千信念将拯救你们的灵魂"}
